- Introduced structured metadata for read operations, including file size, modification time, and read range.
- Implemented logic to return stubs for unchanged file ranges already visible in context, improving efficiency.
- Added XML escaping for file content to prevent parsing issues.
- Enhanced output formatting to include range and overlap notes for better user guidance.
- Updated tests to cover new metadata structure and stub behavior, ensuring robust functionality.

